::  name       hot-edge theme
::  shape      a style: token sheet that recolors the living edge (WADE1 cascade)
::  invariant  each style token is `key value` flat Bron; head stays warm/low-blue
::  example    a dark sheet whose head accent burns terracotta, not the default ochre
::  readers    brush_parse.rye (style sheet) → tokens.rye (infuse) → mantra_browser_heads
::  nib        surface-wade1-theme-v0
::
::  A .brush authoring file that themes the Realidream revision graph. Its style:
::  block overrides three tokens over tokens.rye's base sheet — a dark page, a
::  light ink, and a hotter head accent for the living edge of each lane's history.
::  The head key is the whole point: a theme recolors the newest revision node on
::  its own token, without touching the edge rule or the reading ink. The cascade
::  is per-key infuse (Bron over Bron), never a CSS rail.
::  Tongue: Glow · Bron · TAME · Radiant. Never JS · HTML · CSS · JSON.
::
::  at-nib:     mantra-graph-hot-edge
::  present:    Frame
::  max-lines:  8
::  style:
::    paper 0xFF2B2620
::    ink 0xFFF2ECDF
::    head 0xFFB4502D
::  lines:
::    mantra graph, hot-edge theme
::  refuse:     src/web · Wasm/Web backend · CSS rail · a { } stylesheet
